## Getting Started

```rust
use {crate_name}::{prelude::*, {Type}};

fn main() {
    let instance = {Type}::new({args});
    let result = instance.{method}({args});
    println!("{result:?}");
}
```

## Common Tasks

### {Task 1: e.g., Creating a Resource}

```rust
let resource = {Type}::builder()
    .{field}({value})
    .build()?;
```

### {Task 2: e.g., Querying Data}

```rust
let items = resource.{query_method}({filter})?;
for item in items {
    println!("{item}");
}
```

### {Task 3: e.g., Handling Errors}

```rust
match resource.{method}({args}) {
    Ok(value) => { /* success path */ }
    Err({Error}::{Variant}) => { /* handle specific error */ }
    Err(e) => { /* handle unexpected error */ }
}
```

